<title>USA: U.S. Treasury balances at Fed rose on March 21.</title>
<headline>U.S. Treasury balances at Fed rose on March 21.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Treasury balances at Federal Reserve based on Treasury Department's latest budget statement.</p>
<p>			  (BILLIONS OF DLRS)</p>
<p>				March 21	     March 20</p>
<p>Fed acct			 5.427		  5.369</p>
<p>Tax/loan note acct	  30.092		 33.331</p>
<p>Cash balance		  35.519		 38.700</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Total public debt,     5,282.673	     5,282.066</p>
<p>subject to limit</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Treasury said individual income tax refunds valued at $7.336 billion were issued and $119 million of corporate refunds were issued.</p>
</text>
